      <segment state="reviewed">
        <source>::As soon as your presence becomes known to the two Faceless guards, they raise their weapons in unison, ready to use them. But suddenly, they freeze. The hallway becomes noiseless; even when the two guards lower their weapons you hear no talking nor notice any visible signals between them. Several seconds pass before one of them turns around.::&amp;lt;end&amp;gt;</source>
